{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4cebc048547e0711a150383f85e19ca919a6dbb35ee0e25075237e851c86d2d8", "ja": "奏でよう、太陽のリズム！", "zh": "奏响吧，太阳的节奏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "744f570fb23805fc40566cca2424edad4b84f25704b029f522ef07c24a2188e2", "ja": "プロデューサーに呼び出され、控え室に集\nまったメンバー達。可奈の歌を新曲と信じて\nサンバを踊るが、それは適当な歌だった。\n今回の公演は太陽がテーマと聞いた翼は、\n5人で行きたいところがあると言い出す。", "zh": "制作人找来的成员们聚集在准备室里。\n众人以为可奈唱的歌是新歌，\n跳起了森巴舞，却不料只是随口唱唱。\n翼听到这次公演的主题是太阳之后，\n表示有一个想要五个人一起去的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ca02d2030b0805faa225f5aeaea02359a21b08fd104cad8daaec1fc6ce90b474", "ja": "あ、ひなたちゃん、エレナさん、おはよ～っ。", "zh": "啊，日向、艾琳娜，早安～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "43013435928562749faf84d0ee393845ef223311c43b9a216edbd3060e7dcffd", "ja": "翼さん、エレナさん、おはようさん。\n……ん……あれぇ？", "zh": "啊，翼、艾琳娜，早安呀。\n……嗯……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "301e2d6a58e724de5da5b8b9ee61a122e7f2923ddddb6d9e4b199f2fe734cacb", "ja": "おはよっ♪　ツバサ、ヒナタ！\nどうかしたノ？", "zh": "早啊♪翼、日向！\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "eaff5844508fc2d51f42f009f3b0b56dda0e9e78e8192146479769208a324ea2", "ja": "可奈ちゃんと美奈子さんは、まだ来てないみたい\nだねぇ。ちょっと早くついちゃったべさ。", "zh": "可奈和美奈子好像还没来呢～\n来得有点太早了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e2caeae02ed54e7cfd5e1399349507b914af495dff481c5f0e005e523fd67900", "ja": "わたし達5人で新曲を歌うから、\nその打ち合わせをするんだよね～？", "zh": "这次我们五个人要一起唱新歌，\n所以要来开会讨论是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "4701773729f6e5cf0127fa402e2d2cadfb8149eb27c67fcf7018269656cad279", "ja": "うん、『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』っていう\n曲なんだってねぇ。", "zh": "嗯，听说是一首叫做\n『阳光律动管弦乐♪』的曲子呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "6d7bf256201ed0090abc72d6bb5d6e25a741db86c67aed67a7053353d63dc97d", "ja": "どんな歌なんだろうネ！　やっぱり太陽が関係するの\nかナ？　ワクワクが止まらないヨー♪", "zh": "不晓得会是什么样的歌呢！\n看来应该跟太阳有关吧？真是让人期待到不行耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "937913b59a99c14b58be1e89256188cc6783c74900261546e93251c942340d59", "ja": "だから、みんなで踊って待ってヨ！\nダンスはもちろん、サンバだヨー♪", "zh": "所以大家一起边跳舞边等吧！\n当然，要跳的是森巴舞喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "6b0faae5495309eb66f5d5426656fe1afe0f37808afdebfaaf54c77a78344433", "ja": "ええっ？　サンバかい？", "zh": "咦咦？森巴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "872417cabcd94d8c7df5560e2f331f4f40349a13993e52972d1c38d9f5d2b98c", "ja": "あはっ、そうですね～♪\nうん、踊ろっ、ひなたちゃんも♪", "zh": "啊哈，就是说啊～♪\n嗯，来跳吧，日向也来嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "960a9d7a016e0cba8652f331a5075f7002a61d53d1368c29a751b84b894fe20f", "ja": "け、けど、サンバなんてハイカラな踊り、\nあたし、知らないよぉ？", "zh": "可、可是，森巴那种时髦的舞蹈，\n我不会哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "d8d1aa814d56e4aa13b09726d3e7910d103246c0041971bde3fc6700aa4355e4", "ja": "大丈夫っ！　楽しく、好きに踊ればいいノ♪\nそれじゃあ、行くヨー！", "zh": "放心吧！只要开开心心的随兴跳舞就可以了♪\n那么，开始啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "96ccf9f08da162a516052b928eb939ef4f3d746d832fb01907ca0f9c75ad5872", "ja": "おはようございまーす……わわっ！", "zh": "早安啊……哇哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "d5894a6fcc48a41299d0ba19b507b53e208b2cf21657f250f3ed4ce526e5c01b", "ja": "あれ？　可奈ちゃん、どうしたの……わわっ！", "zh": "咦？可奈，怎么了……哇哇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "a1b58ad9a1bcd3533f4a1c79ad145e92ab9d357811a027170dea15f3fddbc9ae", "ja": "イエーイ！　ヒナタ、その調子だヨっ♪", "zh": "耶～！日向，就是这样唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "5f6f0b40b8ba61a40d6a794d2444d5551349dab7653e0f88f4bb9715de14cca5", "ja": "こ、こうかい？　これでいいのかい？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？这样就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cc35a23033d983feb9b8f538ef07dac8aa80d14e5e3d9d701cd0a4c91f9b8ddf", "ja": "わぁ、ひなたちゃん、すごいすご～い♪", "zh": "哇，日向，好棒好棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "65ca4986f1984be6a41069bae8cccc0d45fca824340f608a243e7b306a604541", "ja": "みんな、踊ってるー！", "zh": "大家都在跳舞──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "65ca4986f1984be6a41069bae8cccc0d45fca824340f608a243e7b306a604541", "ja": "みんな、踊ってるー！", "zh": "大家都在跳舞──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b8e0db471410a9be76e0bcddb43796c2ef314cd3956dac09fd4ca2815ce7f44", "ja": "えへへ、よーし、可奈もサンバに～♪\nまぜまぜ、ま～ぜて～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，好～！可奈也来跳森巴舞～♪\n加我加我，加～上我～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "89d98d953b642d294669824416db8f85a5cb0577f64cf632446735425945d5ef", "ja": "みんみんみんなで踊ったら～♪　\nサンサンサンリズム、オーケストラ～♪", "zh": "大大大家跳起来～♪\n阳阳阳光律动管弦乐～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d04a82c026d0cffb7e1f571f1a1794df2304d04c0613d55bb91554561efd6fdc", "ja": "え？　可奈ちゃん、もしかして、今のが新曲なの？", "zh": "咦？可奈你刚刚唱的该不会是新歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "af059dfc21d433319303fb616e0af101b4658a071c23fdb26a72e61187c7220b", "ja": "ええっ、そうなのかい？\nはや～、やっぱり、楽しそうな歌だべさ！", "zh": "咦咦，是这样吗？\n啊呀～果然是一首很开心的歌哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "d3c08639b469ecf61c4122d8b3d72d65b6d3dabb792b0f50c160ed95d466e0dd", "ja": "カナ、もう1回歌って！\nさっそくみんなで、レッツダンスだヨ～っ♪", "zh": "可奈，你再唱一次！\n大家马上Let's dance吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "124840dce0fd1067f9a905e6737b8427b28f24f7b4f3fb585c74af29793d7ef5", "ja": "えへへ、新曲ってほどじゃないですけど～。\nそれじゃあ、歌っちゃいますね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，也没有到新歌那么厉害啦～\n那我就唱啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "4dd5245a841f39716d2e0622c8b684227825cf345fcb2de2a3e01b95132d5bb8", "ja": "おーおーおーオーケストラ～♪\nトラもオーケー、サンバのリズム～♪", "zh": "管管管管弦乐～♪\n弦乐也OK，森巴的节奏～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f4d599d39e72f0d37842162ad51f5b0af8513ab854ff73172a308c6b13d806f3", "ja": "（控え室の中から、にぎやかな声が聞こえる……。\nみんな、新曲の打ち合わせを楽しみにしてるんだな！）", "zh": "（准备室里传来热闹的声音……\n想必大家都很期待开会讨论新歌吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1027_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "d54c62f5d37f34e6c01b9a95d0b679df344ddd9d2989e97de7fda59c4c6f105a", "ja": "お疲れ様！　みんな前向きで感し……、ん？", "zh": "辛苦了！看大家这么积极……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "efaa93db459a14579127d49cd391707a66ebd947dd476e7b2e90be804e1aad15", "ja": "こんな感じかな？\nエレナちゃん……、ううん、サンバ師匠！", "zh": "像这样子吗？\n艾琳娜……不对，森巴师父！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "072721b08549bcbcad91a178a2b45e09d3ddaabe58d4af81dbd84c1aeec212cf", "ja": "そうそう！　いい感じだヨー♪", "zh": "没错没错！感觉不错喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d86e6c5ea946eda7aa6a660d7b656a0c7b0d54234ddbb37730355d898f72c731", "ja": "……なんだ、この騒ぎは？", "zh": "……这是在热闹什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6b308ebc6e305be5a4b8dc6a6d01fdb606620be4a1e8e0a59a686584118151b8", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、一緒に踊りましょー！\n新曲の『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』！", "zh": "{$P$}先生也一起来跳舞吧～！\n跳这首新歌『阳光律动管弦乐♪』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
