{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "83ab2c4c5924905dc930a3bc5b6f6ebdec6125dad71c39992e4c0e2404485097", "ja": "え～～～！？", "zh": "咦～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "83ab2c4c5924905dc930a3bc5b6f6ebdec6125dad71c39992e4c0e2404485097", "ja": "え～～～！？", "zh": "咦～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "84888d3917eb2a4952a8b7b447c5ab2ceb28c8a089f046e32cc9ef55b432b092", "ja": "……なるほど。つまり翼たちは、可奈の即興ソングを\n『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』だと勘違いして……。", "zh": "……原来如此。也就是说翼你们几个，\n误以为可奈即兴唱的歌就是『阳光律动管弦乐♪』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "79dd8a58f75e2a2f04947f3a5ac27fb5d6baa6a04dc2b6660a843925a39ec107", "ja": "可奈は可奈で、即興ソングを新曲って言ってもらえて\nうれしくなっちゃった、ってことか。", "zh": "然后可奈也真是的，\n听到即兴唱的歌被当成新歌，就得意忘形了是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "76d645ee363e8545ca797211abce6c5cfa28648e2ddd2414a8c68dff8391f1e9", "ja": "はうう。ごめんなさ～い……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "8692b6d8e6996d67f1b02855de5f7a7d6ce2ee5fd2a6d54799ae6fff71b637ca", "ja": "あたし達こそ、早とちりしちゃってゴメンねぇ。", "zh": "我们才该道歉，抱歉擅自误会了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1044_019min", "source_sha256": "838778c4124ae427a535479ee8195e1883aad17d7c568f381f57fb507be16662", "ja": "えへへ、うすうすそんな気はしてたんだけど……\n言い出せなくてごめんね、みんな！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我隐约有猜到……\n只是不好意思说破，抱歉啰大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1045_p", "source_sha256": "f725df59d42a986e90ec222c30087cc68aa58ec70d38cc7796f3d1c6a6c27396", "ja": "まあ、そんなこともあるよ。……それじゃ改めて、\n『サンリズム・オーケストラ♪』を聞いてもらおう！", "zh": "算了，偶尔也会发生这种事嘛……那么回归正题，\n就来听听『阳光律动管弦乐♪』吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "14bbfd19305a49374560de0389da31d0f5359de874baec7f1b0e69ff467404cd", "ja": "わぁ～♪\n聞いてるだけでワクワクしてくる曲ですねっ！", "zh": "哇～♪\n光用听的就让人跃跃欲试呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "9724f5f3b38778469e37cd09ab3d50af69b74cddf5aac1a379d017b888e168af", "ja": "ウン！\n体が勝手にダンスしちゃいそうだヨー♪", "zh": "嗯！\n感觉身体都要自己跳起舞来了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "88f35e6fa524e7fe7e05ea84602e5582259ddd3b104cf4306cf729fd03b7f790", "ja": "ふふっ、さっきの可奈ちゃんの歌と、\nおんなじくらい素敵かも♪", "zh": "呵呵，和刚刚可奈哼的歌一样棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1049_035hin", "source_sha256": "f0910a243f7b43be1e2d06c7b51ce5a149568a2b54b680a99d3f27f5a159bc68", "ja": "ほんとにねぇ。\nどっちをステージで歌ってもいいくらいだべさ。", "zh": "就是说呢～\n都不晓得表演的时候该唱哪一首了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "3d68b626079771a62123ff8e1fb4b5fe9e6883e83042a4a797dd08ab473dfdc0", "ja": "そ、そんな、ふたりともホメすぎですよ～。えへ♪", "zh": "没、没有啦，两位太过奖了～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d03dc0101895c82f4a0d5ac757a780ff7ca22573aa42080dc8c244da8653a23f", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}さん、\n次の公演は太陽がテーマなんですよね？", "zh": "对了！{$P$}先生，\n下次公演的主题是太阳对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e15141c3eb998c3f25a57e4ca8753e2d046b086e50964f7500876940a33a1db0", "ja": "ああ、サンリズムっていうくらいだからな。\nそれがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，毕竟都叫做阳光律动了。\n这部分有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3430743ebd294b6596dc368227750d4451e690db862a165b64d5ae87a2907f0d", "ja": "わたし、みんなで行きたいところができちゃいました♪\n行ってもいいですか～？　ダメぇ？", "zh": "我想到一个希望大家一起去的地方了♪\n可以去吗～？还是不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1054_p", "source_sha256": "0ba7b756faf9fec1f98f0f3711fe559231c6f6004631d0cf4f21fec7550ea327", "ja": "それは場所によるけど……どこに行きたいんだ？\n太陽ってわけじゃないよな？", "zh": "这得看地点而定……你想去哪里？\n应该不会是太阳吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1055_016tsu", "source_sha256": "14511b4b1a03df6c5542533686451ba85159c0ffbf44ae731e885e2f2d754e9e", "ja": "えへへっ、どうかな～？　まだナイショ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，会是哪里呢～？先保密！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1056_p", "source_sha256": "5b604d57b2dff50f219fa41ce796797e0ac4eccc197ffc3dc1e99070c3bbd613", "ja": "……しょうがないな。\nそれじゃ、詳しくは後で聞くとして……。", "zh": "……真拿你没办法。\n那么详细的就之后再说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0048_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0048_story_01_1057_p", "source_sha256": "e4113a5067c0176803953a95b11d0ae220609be0fd5cb40363b2db143d899c4e", "ja": "とにかく公演に向けて、今日から始動だ！\nみんなで楽しい公演にしような！", "zh": "总之从今天起就要准备公演了！\n大家一起打造开心的公演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
